" :answer/id #uuid "623e74da-8a64-5b5e-97fd-8808df31847a"] ["answer-623e74da-8a64-5b5e-97fd-8808df31847a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-623e74da-8a64-5b5e-97fd-8808df31847a" :answer/value "25"] ["answer-3ea3c33a-403d-567e-a88d-49804b37e946" :answer/id #uuid "3ea3c33a-403d-567e-a88d-49804b37e946"] ["answer-3ea3c33a-403d-567e-a88d-49804b37e946" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3ea3c33a-403d-567e-a88d-49804b37e946" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/correct "answer-4f5b549b-f313-5f3a-8a10-a2f5214f2bcb"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/choices "answer-d8b8e27d-8509-52d0-9487-b3bb9fd51889"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/choices "answer-4f5b549b-f313-5f3a-8a10-a2f5214f2bcb"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/choices "answer-82709572-bf25-533e-94a9-6be94d2c36f4"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/choices "answer-623e74da-8a64-5b5e-97fd-8808df31847a"] ["answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a" :answer-field/choices "answer-3ea3c33a-403d-567e-a88d-49804b37e946"] ["question-1b530d38-bb33-510e-b9cb-65e2c39387f5" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-2afd5bb4-fefc-5765-8bdb-316b07bd305a"] [17592186179653 :knowledge-point/questions "question-1b530d38-bb33-510e-b9cb-65e2c39387f5"] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/id #uuid "8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8"] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-133932"] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/problem "![](images/31/31932ff71e679d32ba3abee0276f7a039e5f204649e63feffeb13029eabc5b88.png)\n\nAn ice cream shop wants to determine the relationship between the outside temperature $x$ (in degrees Celsius) and the number of customers $y$ they serve. The scatter plot above shows the information they collected over several days. The equation of the trend line is $y=2.25x-19.$\n\nEstimate the outside temperature if they served $53$ customers."] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/worked-solution "To predict the outside temperature knowing that they served $53$ customers, we need to substitute $y=53$ into the equation of the trend line and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =2.25x-19 \\\\ 53 & =2.25x-19 \\\\ 2.25x & =72 \\\\ x & =32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, according to this model, the outside temperature is approximately ${32}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$\n\nNote: The point where $y=53$ is not shown on our trend line. Therefore, our result *may* be unreliable."] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/id #uuid "fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072"] ["answer-25c938d8-1dfb-5d3f-8853-61890c9bf0cd" :answer/id #uuid "25c938d8-1dfb-5d3f-8853-61890c9bf0cd"] ["answer-25c938d8-1dfb-5d3f-8853-61890c9bf0cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-25c938d8-1dfb-5d3f-8853-61890c9bf0cd" :answer/value "{31.5}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}"] ["answer-a2006beb-9a32-58ef-bcfb-45b833c60509" :answer/id #uuid "a2006beb-9a32-58ef-bcfb-45b833c60509"] ["answer-a2006beb-9a32-58ef-bcfb-45b833c60509" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a2006beb-9a32-58ef-bcfb-45b833c60509" :answer/value "{31}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}"] ["answer-54bf6e94-edcd-5556-960e-3ae854a3d5a8" :answer/id #uuid "54bf6e94-edcd-5556-960e-3ae854a3d5a8"] ["answer-54bf6e94-edcd-5556-960e-3ae854a3d5a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-54bf6e94-edcd-5556-960e-3ae854a3d5a8" :answer/value "{32.5}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}"] ["answer-bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf" :answer/id #uuid "bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf"] ["answer-bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf" :answer/value "{32}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}"] ["answer-2f5d5d01-3161-5cd8-9b54-4a4076db201c" :answer/id #uuid "2f5d5d01-3161-5cd8-9b54-4a4076db201c"] ["answer-2f5d5d01-3161-5cd8-9b54-4a4076db201c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2f5d5d01-3161-5cd8-9b54-4a4076db201c" :answer/value "{33}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/correct "answer-bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/choices "answer-25c938d8-1dfb-5d3f-8853-61890c9bf0cd"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/choices "answer-a2006beb-9a32-58ef-bcfb-45b833c60509"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/choices "answer-54bf6e94-edcd-5556-960e-3ae854a3d5a8"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/choices "answer-bd19dc87-8558-5ba0-9185-3db58ee92bcf"] ["answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072" :answer-field/choices "answer-2f5d5d01-3161-5cd8-9b54-4a4076db201c"] ["question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-fbc8d1ae-cf76-5d8c-94ef-a0c5ef612072"] [17592186179654 :knowledge-point/questions "question-8bba2235-837e-5ee6-9f31-af7dd59da4b8"] ["question-f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb" :question/id #uuid "f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb"] ["question-f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb" :question/math-academy-id "q-133882"] ["question-f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb" :question/problem "![](images/6e/6eb063fffcfd0464cbd8cf79811d9ed2ae1e820a30ec621f50e0cc3b9e150e35.png)\n\nThe scatter plot above gives the correspondence between the variables $x$ and $y$ for some data points.\nThe equation of the trend line is $y=5-0.25x.$ Assuming this trend continues, estimate the value of $y$ when $x=10.$"] ["question-f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb" :question/worked-solution "We can estimate the required value by substituting $x=10$ into the equation of the trend line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =5-0.25x \\\\  & =5-0.25(10) \\\\  & =5-2.5 \\\\  & =2.5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, according to this model, when $x=10,$ we have $y≈2.5.$\n\nNote: The point where $x=10$ is not shown on our trend line. Therefore, our result *may* be unreliable."] ["question-f611e328-34e9-5ebd-abcf-dae6da9bf9cb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-75ef87bd-bbc6-5f5c-a6b4-1dd96adfb505" :answer-field/id #uuid "75ef87bd-bbc6-5f5c-a6b4-1dd96adfb505"] ["answer-1c1a6631-58bb-5134-9a94-217bbe53ee56" :answer/id #uuid "1c1a6631-58bb-5134-9a94-217bbe53ee56"] ["answer-1c1a6631-58bb-5134-9a94-217bbe53ee56" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1c1a6631-58bb-5134-9a94-217bbe53ee56" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-13f4c61a-c56d-54cd-9ef2-fd5516f7e35b" :answer/id #uuid "13f4c61a-c56d-54cd-9ef2-fd5516f7e35b"] ["answer-13f4c61a-c56d-54cd-9ef2-fd5516f7e35b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-13f4c61a-c56d-54cd-9ef2-fd5516f7e35b" :answer/value "1.5"] ["answer-43b4d286-1020-595c-82a9-fd0db5f180b8" :answer/id #uuid "43b4d286-1020-595c-82a9-fd0db5f180b8"] ["answer-43b4d286-1020-595c-82a9-fd0db5f180b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-43b4d286-1020-595c-82a9-fd0db5f180b8" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-b6e1124f-fabb-5356-8775-645e555a22b8" :answer/id #uuid "b6e1124f-fabb-5356-8775-645e555a22b8"] ["answer-b6e1124f-fabb-5356-8775-645e555a22b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b6e1124f-fabb-5356-8775-645e555a22b8" :answer/value "2.5"] ["answer-3da7d80f-588f-5952-bfcd-0334bb39a7f1" :answer/id #uuid "3da7d80f-588f-5952-bfcd-0334bb39a7f1"] ["answer-3da7d80f-588f-5952-bfcd-0334bb39a7f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3da7d80f-588f-5952-bfcd-0334bb3